WEBVTT

00:00:00.414 --> 00:00:02.273
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> <b>Have</b> you <b>ever been</b> to Mexico?

00:00:02.687 --> 00:00:03.727
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I have</b>.

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:05.241
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> When <b>did</b> you <b>go</b> there?

00:00:05.558 --> 00:00:06.575
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I <b>went</b> last year.

00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:10.302
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Jack<b>’s broken</b> his leg.

00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:13.259
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> Oh no! When <b>did</b> that <b>happen</b>?

00:00:13.358 --> 00:00:14.229
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Yesterday.

00:00:14.495 --> 00:00:15.934
He <b>broke</b> it playing football.